{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7d54d0d19917e8d43fe72ab3ad91168.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7d54d0d19917e8d43fe72ab3ad91168.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7d54d0d19917e8d43fe72ab3ad91168.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Classic tabletop games meet roguelite elements and card-based combat. Dice rolls, fate cards,<br>deadly encounters, minigames, and countless unknowns await you in this strange adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what awaits as you roll the dice and move across the board.<br>Collect powerful cards, gather loot, and face fierce enemies to grow your character.<br>Survive eight dangerous regions and reach the end of the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/9d96f45cd7940afa958e94086be20a15.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/9d96f45cd7940afa958e94086be20a15.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/9d96f45cd7940afa958e94086be20a15.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Breed your heroes. Build your legacy. Face the end of the world again and again.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike tabletop adventure, every run begins with the birth of a new hero. <br>Use your limited breeding rights to select two parents, combine their traits,<br>and create a new warrior.  Your hero\u2019s stats, gender, and genetic traits are shaped by<br>the legacy of their bloodline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/b810de208b21c931af456580f78699dc.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/b810de208b21c931af456580f78699dc.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/b810de208b21c931af456580f78699dc.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The path ahead is full of thorns.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face strange events, battle bizarre enemies, and decide whether to return home with your loot <br>or risk one more turn for greater rewards.<br>Each hero ventures through eight dangerous regions, <br>each with its own atmosphere, enemies, and turn-based, randomly generated board. <br>Roll the dice to move through traps, treasures, encounters, and deadly foes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/476899e2a219afd73b77f944f0a6f332.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/476899e2a219afd73b77f944f0a6f332.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/476899e2a219afd73b77f944f0a6f332.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A true hero knows when to retreat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your hero returns to the village before dying, they are added to the ancestral pool.<br>That means your next hero could be their child\u2026 or grandchild. And each generation is born a little stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/491e7e964542f619346577a8084a32ec.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/491e7e964542f619346577a8084a32ec.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/491e7e964542f619346577a8084a32ec.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Genetics matter but nothing beats hard work.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings like the <strong>Barracks</strong>, <strong>Tavern</strong>, <strong>Gold Mine</strong>, or <strong>Ink Mine</strong> to unlock background <br>bonuses for your newborns.<br>Growing up in these places grants them special starting advantages. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/b91df95b04187606eecb718bfbbb9273.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/b91df95b04187606eecb718bfbbb9273.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/b91df95b04187606eecb718bfbbb9273.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Evolve your legacy across generations, and move one step closer to victory with every run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strengthen your bloodline and reach the ancient power at the edge of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will your Seeds of Life vanish\u2026 one by one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/4844714ed3f41cbbb5ff9dea011ce92b.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/4844714ed3f41cbbb5ff9dea011ce92b.webm?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/4844714ed3f41cbbb5ff9dea011ce92b.mp4?t=1761671485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Dark Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An atmospheric 2D world crafted with detailed, hand-painted artwork.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloodline-Based Hero Creation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Combine ancestors, pass down genetic traits, and create stronger heroes with each generation.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Village and Building System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Construct Barracks, Taverns, and Mines to unlock unique backgrounds for newborn heroes.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice-Based Exploration System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Navigate randomly generated boards each turn by rolling the dice.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Turn-Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play your cards strategically \u2014 dodge, strike, and survive through tactical battles.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath and Bloodline Legacy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fallen heroes are lost forever. Those who return strengthen your ancestral pool.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Combat Mechanics and Stat Effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Poison, burn, bleed resistance, dodge and evade \u2014 every stat counts in battle.</i> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Distinct Regions and Dozens of Enemy Types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive in regions filled with unique atmospheres, threats, and foes.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613280?t=1761671485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/38cd9e57940787bb7ea71cd7a911c470a4f8bece/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761671485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/34d77aa3a65ff27a20f5e0bb76d70593ca32b366/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761671485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/34d77aa3a65ff27a20f5e0bb76d70593ca32b366/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761671485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4088020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7d54d0d19917e8d43fe72ab3ad91168.poster.avif?t=1761671485\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7d54d0d19917e8d43fe72ab3ad91168.webm?t=1761